{
    "title": "ALDI USA",
    "description": "Want a quick, easy, and affordable grocery shopping experience? Order ALDI from anywhere with the new and improved ALDI app. Find your local store, select pickup or delivery, fill your cart and just like that, groceries are just a click away. Download the app, sign in or create your account and get started today.\r\n\r\nFeatures of the ALDI App:\r\n\u2022\tStore Locator \u2013 Find your local ALDI, get directions, opening hours, services, and contact information.\r\n\u2022\t Weekly Ads \u2013 Check out this week\u2019s weekly ad, including ALDI Savers and ALDI Finds, while also previewing next week\u2019s Weekly Ads.\r\n\u2022\tALDI Finds \u2013 Discover limited-time only products at incredible prices.\r\n\u2022\tShopping List Tool \u2013 If you\u2019d like to shop in store, save products to your virtual shopping list and use it as you navigate your local ALDI.\r\n\u2022\tAlways Low Prices \u2013 Shop with confidence that you\u2019ll be buying high-quality groceries at an affordable, always low price.\r\n\u2022\tOrder Grocery Pickup and Grocery Delivery \u2013 Choose how you shop with either curbside pickup at your local ALDI or delivery to your home.\r\n\u2022\tView Past Orders \u2013 Re-order a past grocery haul with a single tap or look at past orders and find the products you\u2019ve already purchased.\r\n\r\nStart by downloading the ALDI App and connect it with your ALDI account. You can create one in the app or online. Save money on groceries from home or on the go with the ALDI App today!\r\n\r\nAbout ALDI\r\nAt ALDI, we hand-select and curate high-quality products for you and your family. We can\u2019t promise you\u2019ll find ten choices of the same item, but we can promise you\u2019ll find the best ones at the best price. At our core, we\u2019re a grocery store offering low prices on high quality food, home goods, and other household items. We\u2019re also a fun place to discover new items and explore healthy options.\r\n\r\nALDI Groceries\r\nWe offer groceries to fit everyone\u2019s specific dietary interests, needs or concerns. From organic certified gluten-free products and our meat products that contain no antibiotics, added hormones or animal byproducts, we can fit everyone\u2019s lifestyle.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want a quick, easy, and affordable grocery shopping experience? Order ALDI from anywhere with the new and improved ALDI app. Find your local store, select pickup or delivery, fill your cart and just like that, groceries are just a click away. Download the app, sign in or create your account and get started today.<br><br>Features of the ALDI App:<br>\u2022\tStore Locator \u2013 Find your local ALDI, get directions, opening hours, services, and contact information.<br>\u2022\t Weekly Ads \u2013 Check out this week\u2019s weekly ad, including ALDI Savers and ALDI Finds, while also previewing next week\u2019s Weekly Ads.<br>\u2022\tALDI Finds \u2013 Discover limited-time only products at incredible prices.<br>\u2022\tShopping List Tool \u2013 If you\u2019d like to shop in store, save products to your virtual shopping list and use it as you navigate your local ALDI.<br>\u2022\tAlways Low Prices \u2013 Shop with confidence that you\u2019ll be buying high-quality groceries at an affordable, always low price.<br>\u2022\tOrder Grocery Pickup and Grocery Delivery \u2013 Choose how you shop with either curbside pickup at your local ALDI or delivery to your home.<br>\u2022\tView Past Orders \u2013 Re-order a past grocery haul with a single tap or look at past orders and find the products you\u2019ve already purchased.<br><br>Start by downloading the ALDI App and connect it with your ALDI account. You can create one in the app or online. Save money on groceries from home or on the go with the ALDI App today!<br><br>About ALDI<br>At ALDI, we hand-select and curate high-quality products for you and your family. We can\u2019t promise you\u2019ll find ten choices of the same item, but we can promise you\u2019ll find the best ones at the best price. At our core, we\u2019re a grocery store offering low prices on high quality food, home goods, and other household items. We\u2019re also a fun place to discover new items and explore healthy options.<br><br>ALDI Groceries<br>We offer groceries to fit everyone\u2019s specific dietary interests, needs or concerns. From organic certified gluten-free products and our meat products that contain no antibiotics, added hormones or animal byproducts, we can fit everyone\u2019s lifestyle.",
